{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2022-10-11 18:15:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, A LEADING INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ENCOURAGES TWITTER, INC. INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION INITIATED BY THE FIRM - TWTR', 'text': 'NEW YORK , OCT. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF TWITTER, INC.\xa0(NYSE: TWTR) BETWEEN AUGUST 3, 2020 AND AUGUST 23, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT NOVEMBER 14, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN THE SECURITIES CLASS ACTION COMMENCED BY THE FIRM. SO WHAT:\xa0IF YOU PURCHASED TWITTER SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES OR COSTS THROUGH A CONTINGENCY FEE ARRANGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2022-10-11 15:08:00', 'title': "COTCHETT, PITRE & MCCARTHY AND BOTTINI & BOTTINI FILE SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF TWITTER INVESTORS WHO SOLD STOCK AFTER MUSK'S NOTICE OF TERMINATING TWITTER DEAL (NYSE: “TWTR”)", 'text': 'BURLINGAME, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--COTCHETT, PITRE & MCCARTHY (WWW.CPMLEGAL.COM), AND BOTTINI & BOTTINI ANNOUNCE THAT THEY HAVE FILED A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST ELON MUSK ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS WHO SOLD THE COMMON STOCK AND SECURITIES OF TWITTER, INC. (NYSE: “TWTR”) AT ANY TIME BETWEEN MAY 13, 2022 AND OCTOBER 4, 2022 (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). THE LAWSUIT, CAPTIONED PAMPENA V. ELON MUSK, CASE NO. 3:22-CV-05937, IS PENDING IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE NORTHERN DISTRICT'}{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2022-10-10 19:30:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS TWITTER, INC. - TWTR', 'text': 'NEW YORK , OCT. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF\xa0TWITTER, INC. ("TWITTER" OR THE "COMPANY")\xa0(NYSE: TWTR). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S.'}{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2022-10-08 17:42:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS TWITTER, INC. - TWTR', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - OCTOBER 8, 2022) - POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF TWITTER, INC. ("TWITTER" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: TWTR). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S. WILLOUGHBY AT NEWACTION@POMLAW.COM OR 888-476-6529, EXT. 7980.THE INVESTIGATION CONCERNS WHETHER TWITTER AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS AND/OR DIRECTORS HAVE ENGAGED IN SECURITIES FRAUD OR OTHER UNLAWFUL BUSINESS PRACTICES.'}